Brand thumbnail style guide
title end

paragraph start
A thumbnail has one subject, very few words and the same frame layout every time. It must read at small size on a phone before it is published.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Text on a thumbnail follows the contrast thresholds on the colour palette page. Compare each candidate at phone size next to the previous ones.
paragraph end

code start
